		{"id":"6ace1c8c963131c9","type":"text","text":"- Convolutions & Transpose Convolutions Shape operations -> Done\n- How to calculate the number of weights in CNNs -> Done\n- Do some conv shape exercises\n- Difficult scenario quizzes","x":-424,"y":-120,"width":428,"height":260},
		{"id":"3409568ce754b41f","type":"text","text":"Transfer Learning (Freezing early layers)","x":-705,"y":-1065,"width":261,"height":74},
		{"id":"b7d93e384304e92c","type":"text","text":"`model.requires_grad = False` on all layers except the ones to be modified","x":-315,"y":-1065,"width":490,"height":69},
