		{"id":"8d4f6d26aac4f4cb","type":"text","text":"load the weights -> load the classifier layer -> modify the features count of the classifier layer ","x":-315,"y":-1186,"width":490,"height":61},
		{"id":"c8e0f5b5526ae8a6","type":"text","text":"- The model takes only the images as input, labels are discarded\n- The model returns encoding & decoding (reconstructed image)\n- loss is computed between reconstructed image and original one\n- MSELoss","x":-726,"y":993,"width":603,"height":136},
		{"id":"b7795d03dc3a685c","type":"text","text":"**Theoretical**","x":-335,"y":-373,"width":250,"height":60},
