		{"id":"181013572552e1f4","type":"text","text":"Types of CNN definitions","x":-1425,"y":-867,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"34d8fc31c6dd58a6","type":"text","text":"- Internal Loss calculation (no criterion needed)\n- images & labels are stored as lists not stacked, so have to loop over each image in the batch.\n  The same goes for the target though it is a list of dicts\n- Losses should be added from the classification and regression losses\n- Metrics are different (MAP is used & IoU)","x":-726,"y":1392,"width":684,"height":221},
		{"id":"64200b47fd2418e0","type":"text","text":"- Masks need to be squeezed and type is long\n- No metrics other than loss","x":-726,"y":1210,"width":308,"height":125},
		{"id":"7cb77ae9cb33289f","type":"text","text":"`nn.Sequential()`","x":-1175,"y":-633,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"27909a1789200abc","type":"text","text":"- pred = outputs > 0 (or 0.5 if no sigmoid) and type is float\n- correct = (pred == label).sum.item()","x":-1483,"y":699,"width":442,"height":128},
